								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3075.msg35187#msg35187">Does anyone here subscribe to DavyDs blog?</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> August 09, 2007, 12:38:04 pm &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
